                "accordion_row_riXCbz": {
                  "type": "_accordion-row",
                  "settings": {
                    "heading": "FREE LIFETIME WARRANTY",
                    "open_by_default": false,
                    "icon": "none",
                    "width": 20
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text_t44Btd": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>If you bought it at Wedding Day Diamonds, it's guaranteed. It's just that simple. Even if you lose a diamond from a ring you purchased from Wedding Day Diamonds, we will replace it. If you choose to trade in your diamond, simply find a diamond that retails for at least $1 more than the current market value. All maintenance is free forever. The only thing we are unable to guarantee is that you won't lose your jewelry. For that you need insurance.</p>",
                        "width": "100%",
                        "max_width": "normal",
                        "alignment": "left",
