                    "open_by_default": false,
                    "icon": "none",
                    "width": 20
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text_Fikrny": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>If your center gemstone is lost, Wedding Day Diamonds will honor our warranty by issuing store credit equal to the original purchase price of the gemstone, up to $5,000. This credit may be applied toward a replacement gemstone of your choice. While we cannot guarantee the replacement gemstone will look identical to your original, our team will make every effort to find the closest possible match. Please see full gemstone warranty for details.</p>",
                        "width": "100%",
