                  "blocks": {
                    "text_PmMrCt": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "name": "t:names.text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>If at any time during the first year of ownership you decide that your engagement ring isn’t perfect, we will do whatever it takes to make it perfect, up to and including a total remake. We’re able to make this promise because we have an exclusive Perfect Ring Promise, unequaled quality control, and most important, an absolute commitment to our clients. We are happy to exchange your engagement ring up to a year from your purchase date. You are allowed one exchange within one year. Custom orders ARE included.</p>",
                        "width": "100%",
